  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "gmail-triggers (stack network)",
      "items": [
        "Pages at /garden/gmail-triggers/: Access JWT on every request, CSRF on every form",
        "Polls Gmail every 2 minutes, metadata only; agents never see email bodies",
        "Its only bind mount is state/garden, which the app-server does not mount",
        "Never connects to the app-server; shares no directory with it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Executor (inside the app-server)",
      "items": [
        "Installed by lettucectl in /root/.letta/garden, run by system cron every minute",
        "Fetches pending requests from /executor/v1/ with the stack's token; the tunnel never routes that path",
        "Runs letta cron add --once with an argument array; posts results, the agent list and a heartbeat",
        "Agents can read its token: they can do what it does, which is no more than letta cron add"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Unchanged Lettuce",
      "items": [
        "One app-server socket, owned by the BFF; the scheduler fires the task on it",
        "Each run shows in the Tasks tab as 'Gmail: <rule>'",
        "The agent reads the mail through google-mcp (not drawn)",
        "The app-server's compose config is untouched"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "lettucectl (host)",
      "items": [
        "compose/gmail-triggers.yml behind the gmail-triggers profile (needs google)",
        "Tunnel route ^/garden/gmail-triggers(/|$) to gmail-triggers:8000; ^/garden/?$ to the first garden sidecar that is on",
        "Generates the executor token once per stack; installs and removes the executor with the profile",
        "check_gmail_triggers: one bind mount, no symlinks on its path, Google volumes read-only, no privileges"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust notes",
      "items": [
        "google-creds mounted read-only: a deliberate exception to upstream's intent",
        "A claimed request is never offered twice: a lost turn beats a duplicate",
        "Left out: google-mcp, channel-gateway, searxng, ddg-mcp"
      ]
    }
  ]
}